      "learning_outcomes": "By the end of this course, student is expected to be able to:\n\n1. Understand the basics of materials science, including how they are classified, their bonding, and their structures.\n2. Basic understanding of different classes of materials for different applications.\n3. Gain awareness of the techno-economic and sustainability aspect in materials.\n4. Evaluate the importance of Materials Science in engineering technologies from a broader\ncontext.",
